# Rite of Renewal: both "up to" slots may be empty (CR 601.2c); Bot1's graveyard is empty, so only the player and Bot2's cards are asked. Bot1 targets only Bot2 as the player: no card returns, none is shuffled, but Bot2 still shuffles its library (CR 701.24a, "shuffles up to four target cards ... into their library" with none chosen) and the Rite is exiled. Bot2's graveyard card, a Lightning Bolt, stays in the graveyard.

